ral-File-Cleanup-Audit-Report.md\", \"id\": \"b3c426dc4f33fdd3\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2716647019516593, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.07299494421665617, \"vector_similarity\": 0.73522747, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Audit-Report.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee8496fc8a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Audit-Report.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Audit-Report.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 832, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:06:15\", \"token_count\": 305, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-29\\n\\n# Slack Thread: OCR Temp Cleanup Hooks\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Thread opened**: 2026-08-09\\n\\n**Last activity**: 2026-08-11\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 09:21] Charlie**: Cleanup hooks are in, covering both the failure path and the normal completion path — using the site inventory from the trace so nothing's left out.\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 09:36] Bob**: What happens if the process gets killed outright instead of failing cleanly?\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 09:39] Charlie**: Can't hook a hard kill directly, but between the failure hook and the completion hook we cover everything the OCR branch can reach on its own.\\n\\n**[2026-08-09 10:49] Diana**: I'll run it against the QA scenario that left orphaned files last week and see if it actually clears them.\\n\\n**[2026-08-11 09:09] Diana**: Confirmed — ran it through both the failure case and a normal completion, and the temp files are gone after each. No leftovers.\\n\\n**[2026-08-11 09:30] Charlie**: Good. Secure deletion confirmed — I'll close this out.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 29 slack thread ocr temp cleanup hook channel cipherdoc thread open 2026 08 09 last activ 2026 08 11 2026 08 09 09 21 charli cleanup hook are in cover both the failur path and the normal complet path use the site inventori from the trace so noth s left out 2026 08 09 09 36 bob what happen if the process get kill outright instead of fail clean 2026 08 09 09 39 charli can t hook a hard kill direct but between the failur hook and the complet hook we cover everyth the ocr branch can reach on it own 2026 08 09 10 49 diana i ll run it against the qa scenario that left orphan file last week and see if it actual clear them 2026 08 11 09 09 diana confirm ran it through both the failur case and a normal complet and the temp file are gone after each no leftov 2026 08 11 09 30 charli good secur delet confirm i ll close this out\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"edbfe9608a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-ocr-temp-cleanup-hooks.md\", \"id\": \"c2cece11a183981b\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2686297566993088, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.07307178099901254, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7249317, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-ocr-temp-cleanup-hooks.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"edbfe9608a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-ocr-temp-cleanup-hooks.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-ocr-temp-cleanup-hooks.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1012, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:14\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:16\", \"token_count\": 297, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild an audit-trail system for the redaction pipeline that captures a SHA-256 hash of each input stream together with a companion JSON document recording the redaction map applied to that file, then wire this audit-log generation into the CLI batch path. As of the most recent verification pass, the audit records emitted by the CLI do not match the defined schema, so this remains an open release blocker.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- SHA-256 hash is computed for every input stream and captured in the audit record.\\n\\n- Companion JSON schema pairs the input hash with the redaction map for each processed file.\\n\\n- Audit-log generation is wired into the CLI batch path.\\n\\n- CLI-emitted audit records validate cleanly against the defined companion JSON schema (currently failing verification).\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-26\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-26\\n\\n**Title**: Audit Trail Logging\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild an audit-trail system for the redaction pipeline that captures a SHA-256 hash of each input stream together with a companion JSON document recording the redaction map applied to that file, then wire this audit-log generation into the CLI batch path. As of the most recent verification pass, the audit records emitt