t trail log status activ assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 07 08 activ histori 2026 07 08 diana task creat open\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee5c42ce8a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"id\": \"a51c2421e2cc50c1\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2674753688042414, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.061469426863202, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7481559, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"ee5c42ce8a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2011, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:15\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:06:52\", \"token_count\": 759, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-28\\n\\n# Slack Thread: OCR Temp File Trace\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-07\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 10:03] Charlie**: Tracing every place the OCR branch writes a temp file. We can't add cleanup hooks until we know all the sites that actually create one.\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 10:06] Alice**: How many sites so far?\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 10:19] Charlie**: More than I expected. Some go through the library's default temp handling, some are paths we wrote ourselves. They're not consistent.\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 11:49] Diana**: QA saw a batch fail last week and leave a pile of orphaned temp files behind — that's probably one of the ones you haven't found yet.\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 11:56] Charlie**: Probably. I'm building the full inventory now so nothing gets missed once the hooks go in.\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 13:58] Evan**: Once you've got the list, want a second pass to confirm nothing's hiding behind a library default?\\n\\n**[2026-08-07 13:59] Charlie**: Yeah, that'd help. I'll share the inventory once it's done.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 28 slack thread ocr temp file trace channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 07 2026 08 07 1003 charli trace everi place the ocr branch write a temp file we can t add cleanup hook until we know all the site that actual creat one 2026 08 07 10 06 alic how mani site so far 2026 08 07 10 19 charli more than i expect some go through the librari s default temp handl some are path we wrote ourselv they re not consist 2026 08 07 11 49 diana qa saw a batch fail last week and leav a pile of orphan temp file behind that s probabl one of the one you haven t found yet 2026 08 07 11 56 charli probabl i m build the full inventori now so noth get miss onc the hook go in 2026 08 07 13 58 evan onc you ve got the list want a second pas to confirm noth s hide behind a librari default 2026 08 07 13 59 charli yeah that d help i ll share the inventori onc it s done\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"edc3b7988a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-07-ocr-temp-file-trace.md\", \"id\": \"dea0163e4b91c385\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2671713683341319, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.07683678333447425, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7112854, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-07-ocr-temp-file-trace.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"edc3b7988a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-07-ocr-temp-file-trace.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/