 the success and failur path is outsid the scope of this trace and is not address here\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"eea99e988a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Review.md\", \"id\": \"60fa0292f9004b16\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2592948256887687, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.06648952526966957, \"vector_similarity\": 0.70917386, \"dataset_name\": \"C1WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"eea99e988a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-20-Ephemeral-File-Cleanup-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1093, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:35:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:05:45\", \"token_count\": 435, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-24\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Redaction Preview UI Overlay Design\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 11:18] Diana**: Starting on the redaction preview overlay. Users need to see what's being redacted before the final export. I'm proposing a UI overlay that shows the bounding boxes of detected PII.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 11:19] Charlie**: How are we rendering that? If we're using Electron, we can put an SVG layer over the PDF preview.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 12:54] Diana**: Got a mockup — semi-transparent red blocks for high-confidence matches, yellow for low-confidence ones that need manual review.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 14:19] Charlie**: Scroll sync needs to be exact. If the overlay drifts from the text, the whole thing is useless.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 14:32] Diana**: Using the `pdf.js` coordinate system to map the bounding boxes directly onto the viewport.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 14:36] Alice**: Can users click a box to un-redact it?\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 15:00] Diana**: Not in the first version — it's just a preview for now. Toggling redactions will be part of the manual review workflow.\\n\\n**[2026-08-04 15:39] Diana**: I'll share the CSS for the highlighter blocks shortly.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 24 slack thread redact preview ui overlay design channel cipherdoc date 2026 08 04 2026 08 04 11 18 diana start on the redact preview overlay user need to see what s be redact befor the final export i m propos a ui overlay that show the bound box of detect pii 2026 08 04 11 19 charli how are we render that if we re use electron we can put an svg layer over the pdf preview 2026 08 04 12 54 diana got a mockup semi transpar red block for high confid match yellow for low confid one that need manual review 2026 08 04 14 19 charli scroll sync need to be exact if the overlay drift from the text the whole thing is useless 2026 08 04 14 32 diana use the pdf j coordin system to map the bound box direct onto the viewport 2026 08 04 14 36 alic can user click a box to un redact it 2026 08 04 15 00 diana not in the first version it s just a preview for now toggl redact will be part of the manual review workflow 2026 08 04 15 39 diana i ll share the cs for the highlight block short\", \"dataset_id\": \"918880948a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"ee1007248a9911f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-04-redaction-preview-overlay.md\", \"id\": \"2de3b4a7f1d047d3\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.25082357898513735, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similari